WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:11.420
Hello!

2
00:00:11.421 --> 00:00:15.117
Hello!

3
00:00:15.118 --> 00:00:18.390
Who are you?

4
00:00:18.391 --> 00:00:22.127
I'm a sea lion.

5
00:00:22.128 --> 00:00:26.501
We are sea mammals.

6
00:00:26.502 --> 00:00:28.703
Where do you live?

7
00:00:28.704 --> 00:00:33.895
Most sea lions live near the Pacific Ocean.

8
00:00:33.896 --> 00:00:37.377
We live along the coast.

9
00:00:37.378 --> 00:00:41.572
We also live on islands.

10
00:00:41.573 --> 00:00:45.046
You look like a seal.

11
00:00:45.047 --> 00:00:48.134
We are different from seals.

12
00:00:48.135 --> 00:00:51.930
We can walk with our strong flippers.

13
00:00:51.931 --> 00:00:55.461
Seals can't do that.

14
00:00:55.462 --> 00:00:58.125
Are you a good swimmer?

15
00:00:58.126 --> 00:01:01.933
Yes. We are great swimmers.

16
00:01:01.934 --> 00:01:04.806
We're really fast.

17
00:01:04.807 --> 00:01:08.892
We can also dive deep.

18
00:01:08.893 --> 00:01:12.420
You have a lot of friends!

19
00:01:12.421 --> 00:01:16.331
Sea lions live in big groups.

20
00:01:16.332 --> 00:01:20.337
We lie in the sun together.

21
00:01:20.338 --> 00:01:26.271
And we bark very loudly.

22
00:01:26.272 --> 00:01:29.628
What do you eat?

23
00:01:29.629 --> 00:01:33.629
We eat lots of fish.

24
00:01:33.630 --> 00:01:38.121
We also like squid and shellfish.

25
00:01:38.122 --> 00:01:41.470
Do you have any enemies?

26
00:01:41.471 --> 00:01:44.788
Killer whales hunt us.

27
00:01:44.789 --> 00:01:49.299
Great white sharks hunt us too.

28
00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:52.580
I'm going to lie in the sun.

29
00:01:52.581 --> 00:01:57.288
See you later!

30
00:01:57.289 --> 00:02:02.079
Good-bye, Sea Lion!
